        "_comment": "Dataset-availability constraint on the whole HadGEM3-A Attribution ensemble (hurs single-month files only start at 201911, and all four variables have continuous single-month files 201911..202502) -- global, not region-specific, since it gates which raw files the loader reads before any region/country is selected.",
