        "end_month": 202412,
        "start": "2019-11-01",
        "end": "2024-12-30"
    },

    "_regions_comment": "List months in event order. Set season_wrap to false for an event inside one calendar year. Set season_wrap to true for an event that crosses the year boundary (for example December to January); list the months in order (for example [12, 1]) and set event_year to the START year (the earlier, December year).",

